        "alt": "温泉旅館の門前の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "main.s1.w05.asset.sprite.mimi.confused",
        "kind": "sprite",
        "path": "/assets/story/sprites/mimi-confused-v1.png",
        "alt": "困惑するミミ"
      },
      {
        "id": "main.s1.w05.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "kind": "sprite",
        "path": "/assets/story/sprites/mimi-smile-v1.png",
        "alt": "笑顔のミミ"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w05.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w05.asset.sprite.mimi.confused",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "山道のバス、硫黄の匂いが先に来る。膝の上に、大会の白い封筒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "隣の席から通路まで、うちの選手がぎゅうぎゅう。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "行き先は温泉旅館「鏡見の湯」だ。賞品として、あるいは商店会の押し切りで旅は決まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日の目標はひとつ。仕事を、忘れる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "忘れさせてくれなかった。出発直前、速達が私を追いかけてきた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "差出人、闘技場計測室。「貴チームの測定値、計測上限を超過」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「規定により、ランクを最上級へ訂正します」",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最上級。同封のランク表を見る。銅、鉄、銀、金、竜金——そして最上級。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "普通は一段ずつ、何年もかけて上がる階段らしい。うちは初戦で、七段飛ばした。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "バスの中で、回し読みが始まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "選手たちは妙に嬉しそう。「最上級」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ほう、最上級」「ふふ。最上級」響きだけで三回楽しめる人たち。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.005d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.005d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私だけ、要項の「義務」の頁を探してた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "同封の選手証は顔写真入り、つやつやの金縁だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "派遣の名札より立派な身分証、人生で初めて持った。持ちたかった形とは、ちょっと違う。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "車窓が山に変わる頃、気づいた。この速達、宛名が「監督 ミミ様」とある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "暫定でも、代理でもなく。誰かの書き間違いのはず。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "なのに、封筒を捨てられない。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "隣の席から、ひょいと封筒を覗かれた。「監督、と書いてあるな」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「見ないでください」「事実ではないか」耳が、かあっと熱くなった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「事実じゃないんです、まだ」……まだ? 自分で言って、自分でつまずいた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.direction.mimi.shift.009",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w05.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "宿が見えた。谷あいに灯り、湯気が立ってる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "門前の効能書き、大きな筆文字。「すべての疲れに効く」すべて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……名義の疲れにも、効くだろうか。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "バスを降りると、山の空気が冷たい。湯の匂いが濃い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "肩の力が、勝手に抜けていく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日はもう、手帳を開かない。開かないったら、開かない。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "暖簾の前で、仲居さんが深々と頭を下げた。「お待ちしておりました——最上級の皆さま」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「お布団、上等なのに替えておきました」「最上級ですので」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.line.011c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w05.line.011c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……もう知られてる。ランクで布団が変わる宿だった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w05.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
